        "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2221390/extras/d75d100b38435471a16741c2e4d1fb46.avif?t=1779968799\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2221390/extras_big/d75d100b38435471a16741c2e4d1fb46.avif?t=1779968799 width=800 height=152 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2221390/extras/23ef54f145b269c1ba49597299044b18.poster.avif?t=1779968799\" width=620 height=180 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2221390/extras/23ef54f145b269c1ba49597299044b18.webm?t=1779968799\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2221390/extras/23ef54f145b269c1ba49597299044b18.mp4?t=1779968799\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i><strong>Damned 2</strong></i> is an asymmetrical multiplayer horror game where four survivors must explore cursed locations, solve puzzles, and escape alive — while a fifth player takes on the role of a deadly creature hunting them down. Each match is unpredictable and filled with tension. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2221390/extras/3923099520d0749bb9d860d94368263b.avif?t=1779968799\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2221390/extras_big/3923099520d0749bb9d860d94368263b.avif?t=1779968799 width=800 height=152 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2221390/extras/192ae4b80b4687960191cb1fe20bdd07.poster.avif?t=1779968799\" width=620 height=180 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2221390/extras/192ae4b80b4687960191cb1fe20bdd07.webm?t=1779968799\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2221390/extras/192ae4b80b4687960191cb1fe20bdd07.mp4?t=1779968799\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >To escape, survivors must search for items, unlock doors, and complete puzzles scattered across the map. Every match reshuffles key elements, requiring players to adapt quickly. Teamwork, awareness, and a steady hand are essential.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2221390/extras/53004bb6035d19614273dcf4d6898218.avif?t=1779968799\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2221390/extras_big/53004bb6035d19614273dcf4d6898218.avif?t=1779968799 width=800 height=152 /></span> </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"> <span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2221390/extras/abaf5a2c31c94675db055534afbf9ca4.poster.avif?t=1779968799\" width=620 height=180 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2221390/extras/abaf5a2c31c94675db055534afbf9ca4.webm?t=1779968799\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2221390/extras/abaf5a2c31c94675db055534afbf9ca4.mp4?t=1779968799\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Take control of a terrifying creature with unique abilities. Each monster offers a different playstyle — some stalk in silence, others create chaos and confusion. Master their skills and turn every match into a psychological horror experience. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2221390/extras/ccd95cb76e6d4eba21520ec377703fd0.avif?t=1779968799\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2221390/extras_big/ccd95cb76e6d4eba21520ec377703fd0.avif?t=1779968799 width=800 height=152 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2221390/extras/90930958685043c7491d11070062ace1.poster.avif?t=1779968799\" width=620 height=180 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2221390/extras/90930958685043c7491d11070062ace1.webm?t=1779968799\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2221390/extras/90930958685043c7491d11070062ace1.mp4?t=1779968799\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > </p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > <strong>Immersive Audio Visual experience:</strong>  Damned 2 uses Unreal Engine 5 to bring graphics and audio immersion to a new level of horror.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >  </p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > <strong>Immersive VOIP:</strong> Our built in VOIP system simulates echos, reverberation and the environment around you. But be aware, monsters can hear you when they are hunting!</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > <strong>Be the Monster!:</strong> Choose from a variety of different monsters to play and scare your friends, each monster has a set of abilities for you to hunt and eliminate the trespassers. The monster can also be controlled by an AI.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > <strong>Co-operate:</strong> Play together with your friends with up to 5 players where teamwork is key for fast puzzle solving and exploration.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >  </p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > <strong>Randomized Environments &amp; Puzzles:</strong> Each play through is never the same. Keys, items and puzzles are placed in different locations whenever you start a new match.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >  </p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > <strong>Custom Difficulty:</strong> Choose your game settings before starting a new match, customize the way you want to play. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2221390/extras/48d4ddf2ed31f75e0ffbc8443a6bb006.avif?t=1779968799\" width=616 height=220 /></span></p>",
